* Set metaroom variables
setv game "c12dsl::metaroom::id" va01

* GET METAROOM X/Y
setv va99 0
sets va98 mloc va01

* Get Metaroom X
setv va97 sins va98 1 " "
setv va96 va97
subv va96 1
setv game "c12ds::metaroom::x" stoi subs va98 1 va96

* GET Metaroom Y
addv va97 1
setv va96 sins va98 va97 " "
subv va96 1
setv game "c12ds::metaroom::y" stoi subs va98 va97 va96
